+|---|---|---|---|
+| correct | correct | 10 | q-01, q-02, q-03, q-04, q-05, q-11, q-12, q-14, q-15, q-20 |
+| wrong | refused | 3 | q-07, q-09, q-19 |
+| partial | partial | 2 | q-10, q-16 |
+| wrong | partial | 2 | q-17, q-18 |
+| wrong | wrong | 1 | q-06 |
